WEBVTT

00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:04.540
I-Illya, that's...

00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:05.550
Huh?

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.770
Ow!

00:00:10.770 --> 00:00:14.410
Can't you be a little more gentle with me?

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:19.200
Oh, I'm talking about the left hand, too.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:29.250
Jeez, this is unbelievable.

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:32.090
I'm the one who's most surprised of all.

00:00:32.090 --> 00:00:34.940
Still, this really is bad.

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:37.200
I never thought it would end up like this.

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.760
You've sure done something rash, haven't you?

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:43.630
So how do you plan on taking responsibility?

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:44.480
Well?

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:46.650
No!

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:48.980
This pattern again?

00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:50.520
Wait, Illya!

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:52.460
Don't attack him for no reason!

00:00:53.740 --> 00:00:59.070
B-But... But... I feel like something 
precious of mine has been tainted!

00:00:59.390 --> 00:01:03.000
I don't quite get it, but calm down for now.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.500
But, goodness, what in the world's going on here?

00:01:08.770 --> 00:01:11.120
That's what I'd like to ask.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:14.170
I'm confused by this sudden mess myself.

00:01:14.890 --> 00:01:18.790
This is not right at all. 
It shouldn't be all mixed up like this.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.560
L-Look, you...

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:25.040
At least do something about 
your appearance for now!

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:27.960
Have you no shame?

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.990
What, that? Don't worry.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:31.650
Huh?

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:35.540
There is nothing shameful about my body.

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:38.240
<i>W-Worldwide!</i>

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:41.180
That's not what I'm talking about!

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:43.910
Ah, yes, yes, now the rapid fire.

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:46.250
I've come to understand your pattern.

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:47.720
Is this good enough?

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:49.580
Of course it's not!

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:52.380
Oh, all right, fine.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:54.760
You want me to clothe myself, right?

00:01:54.990 --> 00:01:56.800
But with the way I am now...

00:01:57.030 --> 00:02:01.140
I am unsure if it's connecting properly, 
so don't expect too much, okay?

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:04.790
Ah, there really is nothing good in here...

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:03.120
What's that?

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:08.350
It's most likely the same thing that was 
producing infinite Noble Phantasms.

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:08.350
Let's see... Clothes, clothes... There!

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:10.660
Then this boy really is...

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:13.460
Seems so. His appearance is different,

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:16.720
but he's the Heroic Spirit of the eighth Card!

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:21.550
Now we can talk, right?

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:54.210
<b>Episode 9 
Golden Boy</b>

00:03:57.930 --> 00:03:58.710
What?

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:03.530
The formula activated.

00:04:04.070 --> 00:04:06.850
The formula? For the Holy Grail War?

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:08.350
Hey, you're...

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:14.150
This is backlash from my observation 
spell. Don't worry about it.

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:17.740
That's easy for you to say...

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:20.530
This is merely something that must happen.

00:04:21.710 --> 00:04:25.140
I am but a canary.

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:27.370
More importantly...

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:33.660
This formula is not that of the Einzberns.

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.670
So someone else is...

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:40.290
My job is only to observe.

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:44.680
I cannot intrude on what comes next, so...

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:49.010
I shall tell you the information I know.

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:50.200
The vortex...

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:52.220
It keeps spreading wider!

00:04:57.420 --> 00:05:00.900
Oh, looks like things are going 
smoothly over there.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:04.440
The scale of the incarnation is increasing.

00:05:04.440 --> 00:05:05.640
Be careful.

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.990
If you touch that muck, you'll probably die.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.010
What?

00:05:09.010 --> 00:05:11.340
<i>Who is this boy?</i>

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:12.740
<i>What does he know?</i>

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:14.900
<i>He couldn't be...</i>

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:19.980
<i>He couldn't be!</i>

00:05:22.350 --> 00:05:24.880
I see no reason for us to match speeds.

00:05:25.200 --> 00:05:26.640
I'm going on ahead.

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:27.340
Me, too!

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.500
Luvia...

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:30.390
What is it?

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:31.850
Did you know?

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.600
No, I just

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.770
prepared myself for it.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:42.320
Something strange happened 
around three months ago.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:45.390
The area directly above the great cavern,

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:51.560
a tree-filled area with a 180-meter 
radius, vanished without warning.

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:53.480
Vanished?

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:57.540
That area became an isolated wasteland.

00:05:57.950 --> 00:05:59.350
Directly afterward...

00:05:59.780 --> 00:06:03.410
No, probably at exactly the same time,

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:06.530
we believe the Cards appeared in Fuyuki City.

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:09.970
Then, and this is the important part...

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:15.100
I observed people going in and 
out of the great cavern.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:21.770
One day, the number entering it 
didn't match the number exiting it.

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:28.380
This was before you emerged 
from the great cavern, as well.

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:37.110
Three months ago, on the day the trees 
vanished and the Cards appeared...

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:42.630
A person suddenly appeared from the great 
cavern, though no one had entered it.

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:44.500
That person was...

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.550
The Cards are...

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:48.510
Pulsing?

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:54.140
Oh, you have Cards on you?

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:57.400
It appears the other Cards 
are drawing near, as well.

00:06:57.400 --> 00:07:00.730
I guess they really are drawn 
to each other, right...

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:02.480
Miyu-chan?

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:06.190
It can't be... You...

00:07:06.490 --> 00:07:09.150
I'm different from other Heroic Spirits.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:14.200
I'm sorry. It seems the other half 
of me really wants the Holy Grail.

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:20.910
I guess the remains left in that 
formula weren't enough for him.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:22.380
Stop it.

00:07:22.980 --> 00:07:27.670
Even if we wanted to continue the Holy Grail 
War, it would go nowhere without you.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.170
Stop it.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:31.800
After all, you're...

00:07:32.070 --> 00:07:34.850
Don't you dare say another word!

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:42.350
<i>Back then, something felt wrong.</i>

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:44.400
<i>The ley lines' core...</i>

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:51.890
<i>The ley lines in a 400-meter radius around 
the great cavern had shifted slightly.</i>

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:56.660
<i>I thought it was some mistake, that it was 
impossible for them to shift like that.</i>

00:07:57.180 --> 00:07:58.510
<i>But then,</i>

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:04.340
<i>given that, along with the disappearance 
of the trees above the great cavern...</i>

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:09.930
<i>It's only circumstantial evidence, 
but everything matches up.</i>

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:11.260
<i>In other words,</i>

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:16.590
<i>the entire area around the great cavern was 
swapped with one from another world!</i>

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:19.930
<i>Then, in that case...</i>

00:08:20.380 --> 00:08:22.230
<i>If Miyu came from there...</i>

00:08:29.720 --> 00:08:34.450
You've become quite the tomboy, 
when all you used to do was sleep.

00:08:34.630 --> 00:08:36.950
Was that, perchance, a secret,

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:42.620
Princess From a Parallel World?

00:08:44.670 --> 00:08:47.650
Parallel world?

00:08:48.370 --> 00:08:49.130
<i>Yes.</i>

00:08:49.510 --> 00:08:52.650
<i>I knew this day would come eventually.</i>

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:54.340
<i>However, Miyu...</i>

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:57.150
<i>Even so, you're still</i>

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:59.330
<i>my little sister!</i>

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.480
Parallel world?

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:13.490
Sorry. It's not my hobby to go around 
revealing other people's secrets,

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:17.450
but given our current situation, I had to.

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:21.270
I hope you'll accept it as 
bad luck, and just give up.

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:24.740
Consider this your fate.

00:09:25.870 --> 00:09:28.100
Wh-What do you mean?

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:30.380
What in the world are you talking about?

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:33.820
Oh, I must thank you all, as well.

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:39.090
When I was lost in the boundary, you came 
from the real number region and found me.

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:44.490
Miyu?

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:51.400
How violent. He's already done 
taking over the formula?

00:09:53.100 --> 00:09:54.230
<i>Schneiden!</i>

00:09:56.740 --> 00:10:02.200
Ah, I thought so. Maybe it's because
the incarnation stopped partway?

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:07.070
It looks like most of the armor 
in my treasury is with that one.

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:09.040
Illya...

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:10.780
Miyu?!

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.930
You shouldn't push yourself too much.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:27.050
That's also me, the Heroic Spirit.

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:30.920
The oldest King of Heroes, 
who gathered all the Earth's treasures...

00:10:30.920 --> 00:10:33.660
I find it hard to imagine you 
stand a chance of winning.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:39.640
Honestly... The ritual to call forth that 
omnipotent wish-granting device,

00:10:39.640 --> 00:10:41.030
the Holy Grail War...

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:46.750
It tries to use even us Heroic Spirits 
to do it, so it's nothing but trouble.

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:49.580
Quit fooling around!

00:10:49.840 --> 00:10:54.460
The one you're trying to do
something to is Miyu, isn't it?

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:03.400
Is Miyu...

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:07.180
Was Miyu born for the Holy Grail War's sake, too?

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:12.650
"Too"? Oh, so you're involved with 
the Holy Grail War, as well?

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:15.210
Well, it's not that uncommon.

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:20.110
It is a ritual that's been repeated 
across many ages, in many worlds.

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:24.280
Miyu!

00:11:37.800 --> 00:11:40.750
But you know, she's special.

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:42.680
Stop it...

00:11:48.180 --> 00:11:49.180
Stop it!

00:11:49.410 --> 00:11:52.630
You ask if she was born for 
the Holy Grail War's sake?

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:54.900
Stop it!

00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:01.000
It's the reverse.

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:04.660
The Holy Grail War was created for her sake.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:09.120
She was born a complete version of the Holy Grail.

00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:14.000
The Cards and I were both created for her sake.

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:18.250
She's the cause, the root of everything, 
and the destination for it all.

00:12:19.140 --> 00:12:21.600
She is all of that.

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:25.340
The Holy Grail? Miyu-san?

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:28.710
Natural born, and all filled up.

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:32.310
She's a real rarity,
extremely close to the original.

00:12:35.920 --> 00:12:39.350
A human who happens to possess 
the Holy Grail's functions.

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:44.950
Or more precisely, a Holy Grail with 
an almost human personality.

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:50.410
Either way, she's a defective irregularity 
born of her world itself.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:52.910
Look, you...

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:58.460
<i>The root of everything, defective... Yes, I'm...</i>

00:12:58.890 --> 00:13:01.430
<i>This is my fault. All of it...</i>

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:04.420
<i>I should never have come here.</i>

00:13:04.740 --> 00:13:08.280
<i>I shouldn't have wanted anything...</i>

00:13:16.070 --> 00:13:17.070
Miyu!

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:21.110
It was

00:13:21.640 --> 00:13:22.890
no use...

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:27.950
Though I rejected it, 
struggled against it, and ran from it,

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:29.200
it was futile.

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:33.160
Miyu!

00:13:35.880 --> 00:13:37.040
Don't give up!

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:37.870
Give me your hand!

00:13:39.270 --> 00:13:40.420
This is

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:44.390
my fate.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.510
Miyu-sama!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:54.430
Break it. Along with me. End this nightmare.

00:13:55.690 --> 00:14:00.220
I'm sorry to have dragged you into 
this, when you weren't involved.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:02.380
I'm sorry

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:07.000
I was never able to tell you.

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.950
Miyu!

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:12.540
Goodbye.

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.870
Miyu... Why?

00:14:25.070 --> 00:14:26.880
Just as she said.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.550
This was her fate.

00:14:29.730 --> 00:14:31.050
How can you be so selfish?!

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:36.520
Don't be angry with me. Be angry at her fate,

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.600
or the adults who tried to use her.

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:43.460
And take it out on this pitiful, 
bloated version of me

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:47.860
that's lost its reason.

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:51.570
What is that?

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:55.870
Is that a Heroic Spirit?

00:14:56.150 --> 00:14:57.100
Yeah.

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:58.830
It's very ugly, isn't it?

00:14:59.110 --> 00:15:04.670
Since I've been cut off from it and 
incarnated, I'm not on either side.

00:15:04.890 --> 00:15:09.130
But still, I think doing this would be most natural.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:12.380
You won't be stopping this war anymore.

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:16.140
If you don't want to die, 
then leave the Cards and run.

00:15:22.760 --> 00:15:24.970
How can you say that?

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:27.080
Miyu and that boy...

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:27.730
Illya-san?

00:15:27.730 --> 00:15:29.110
...are both too selfish!

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:34.950
Include!

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:43.470
A replica cannot beat the original.

00:15:58.340 --> 00:15:59.970
If only you'd run away...

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:04.090
I can't believe you'd waste your life like this.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.160
I'm surprised.

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:19.950
If you'd had one more stick, 
that could have been bad.

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:21.910
Where's Miyu?

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:23.620
Inside me.

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:26.200
Right about dead center, I think.

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.100
She's still alive.

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:29.710
But be careful.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:33.260
You might end up dying here.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:35.640
Try and dodge them.

00:16:36.580 --> 00:16:37.600
Illya-san!

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:41.520
Kuro!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:45.270
Are you an idiot, trying to fight 
this thing without transforming?

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:50.910
More importantly, what is this thing?

00:16:51.730 --> 00:16:55.450
Judging from its method of attack... 
It's likely the eighth Card.

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:56.860
Bazett-san!

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:59.700
Still, how did it take this grotesque shape?

00:17:04.310 --> 00:17:06.790
Tell us what happened, Illya!

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:13.510
Regardless, it's still an enemy!

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:25.390
I understand, but I don't want to believe it.

00:17:25.390 --> 00:17:27.020
Miyu's inside that?

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:28.940
But what do we do?

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:31.210
Even if we want to save her, that...

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:35.110
Miyu said to break it, along with her.

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:36.650
So what?

00:17:37.230 --> 00:17:39.570
She said that was her fate.

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:43.020
She said it didn't involve us.

00:17:49.030 --> 00:17:50.250
So what?

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:53.250
Does that mean you'll just abandon her?

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:54.510
No!

00:17:56.610 --> 00:17:58.040
No, it doesn't.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:08.480
I'll wait until those wounds of yours are healed.

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:13.700
Find your answer in that time, and give it shape.

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:20.700
Just to ask... Got a plan?

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:23.350
Pound the core of that thing.

00:18:23.350 --> 00:18:24.790
That's our only option.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:25.980
I'm in.

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:30.410
That's much more realistic than trying 
to blow the whole thing away.

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:35.340
I'm grateful. Having it divided between 
targets will make getting close easier.

00:18:35.340 --> 00:18:37.300
My, aren't you honest?

00:18:37.530 --> 00:18:42.420
I do acknowledge your skill, somewhat.

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:44.470
No, the skills of both of you.

00:18:45.120 --> 00:18:47.390
Well, thanks!

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:05.580
<i>Trace, Overedge.</i>

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:19.380
Kuro should be in pain, too.

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:23.140
Did Miyu feel like this too, I wonder?

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:27.150
When she was fighting Berserker...

00:19:27.150 --> 00:19:29.250
When I ran from it...

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:33.980
Miyu fought that opponent she barely stood 
a chance of beating alone, didn't she?

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:36.270
Why did she do it?

00:19:37.350 --> 00:19:39.410
Miyu-sama said...

00:19:40.810 --> 00:19:44.360
Illya was my first friend.

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:50.660
Yeah, I see.

00:19:55.440 --> 00:20:00.920
It seems that when my body is bigger, 
my attacks are rougher, too.

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:03.660
Well, in that case...

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:12.440
Might as well make them even rougher.

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:20.400
I can't exactly ask you to dodge them anymore.

00:20:21.520 --> 00:20:23.360
That attack range...

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:27.830
It's dangerous, Illya-san!

00:20:27.830 --> 00:20:29.160
He's going to mow us down!

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:30.540
What are you doing, Illya?

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:33.080
You should run away by yourself!

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.700
I can't run away.

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:37.410
There's no way I can run away.

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:41.330
I finally understand what I need to do.

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:45.260
I have to slap Miyu!

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:46.460
Huh?

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:47.260
What?

00:20:47.490 --> 00:20:49.640
Sapphire! Lend me your power!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.600
Yes!

00:20:53.780 --> 00:20:55.650
Ruby, you too!

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.640
There's no helping you.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:59.230
Let's do this!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:20.920
Just what are you?

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:25.220
No way...

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:29.760
Miyu, you know...

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:33.520
I'm mad at you.

00:21:34.700 --> 00:21:36.810
"Break it. Along with me"?

00:21:36.810 --> 00:21:40.900
"I'm sorry to have dragged you into 
this, when you weren't involved"?

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:42.360
Those...

00:21:42.910 --> 00:21:45.570
Those aren't things you say to a friend!

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:49.920
I'm going to drag you out of there and slap you!

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:36.050
<b>Next Time 
Calling Your Name From a Corner of the World</b>

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:25.250
Ruby, you weren't at full strength, were you?

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:29.490
My muscles, my veins, my nerves...

00:23:29.490 --> 00:23:32.000
Use everything I have!
